  "limitations": [
    "syscalls_attempted contains calls with numeric returns; non-returning exit_group calls are audited separately by exit code.",
    "One traced multi-change and one independently validated silent repeat per side; counts are mechanism evidence, not a distribution.",
    "Tracing perturbs execution and scheduling; no trace timestamp, duration or CPU comparison is used.",
    "Wire LOOKUP/INVOKE counts are sends containing a complete header. Receiver byte/count/order/status checks independently establish acceptance.",
    "Connection reuse does not reduce object lookup count: every changed entry still resolves service before invoking.",
    "Write totals cover all subject-tree descriptors, including pipes, logs and sockets, and are not baseline-only write counts.",
    "C denotes the exact shell script and its actual BusyBox/UCI/ubus command tree; in-process BusyBox applets need not exec.",
    "The old UCI canonical ELF is a short incremental reference, not a fifth side in the formal router matrix."
